OL,3,GNEWSAFlooded toilets at school blamed
OL,4,Aon funding gap
OL,5,
OL,6,FA school said its "dream" was to
OL,7,Fprovide working toilets for its pupils
OL,8,Fbut it could not afford to replace its
OL,9,Ffacilities.
OL,11,FChildren have twice been sent home from
OL,12,FWood End Infant and Pre-school in
OL,13,FMilton Keynes after the site's toilets
OL,14,Fflooded due to drainage issues.
OL,16,FThe school said it could not afford to
OL,17,Freplace the toilets as it currently had
OL,18,Fabout #123,000 less to spend compared
OL,19,Fwith 2010/11.
